DefaultClassificationCriteria"], 
   RowBox[{"[", "]"}]}]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "31aed207-73e2-2449-b10d-e768b1c1630f"],
 " \[LineSeparator]",
 "gives the default quantitative classification criteria used by \
[ClassifyCandidate](paclet:SamuelFrerichs/StructureAdaptiveEvolution/ref/\
ClassifyCandidate).",
 "\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   ButtonBox["DefaultClassificationCriteria",
    BaseStyle->"Link",
    ButtonData->
     "paclet:SamuelFrerichs/StructureAdaptiveEvolution/ref/\
DefaultClassificationCriteria"], 
   RowBox[{"[", "params", "]"}]}]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "40200719-7213-5b41-aba4-f5f84d99889b"],
 " \[LineSeparator]",
 "overrides thresholds by name.",
 Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
  "77f7bebb-4b80-394c-b2a0-3f9c5d04b9d5"]
}], "Usage",
 CellID->113205264,ExpressionUUID->"1d7cc0be-21a8-6c43-ac1e-9fe64b73da55"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Each label has a \"Description\" and either \"AllOf\" -> {",
 StyleBox["condition",
  FontSlant->Italic],
 ", ...} or \"AnyOf\" -> {{",
 StyleBox["condition",
  FontSlant->Italic],
 ", ...}, ...}. A condition is an Association with \"Metric\", \"Test\" \
(\"AtLeast\", \"AtMost\", \"Equals\" or \"Within\"), \"Value\" and optional \
\"Tolerance\" and \"Parameters\"."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->276977199,ExpressionUUID->"2bb59655-9bd9-d64c-894a-e1439ec1cefd"],

Cell["\<\
Threshold names include \"MinNonIsomorphicTerminalStates\" (3), \
\"MinMeanTerminalVertexCount\" (5), \"TargetDimension\" (2.), \
\"DimensionTolerance\" (0.5), \"SpaceLikeMaxDimensionVariance\" (0.25), \
\"MinLargestComponentRatio\" (0.9), \"HomogeneousMaxDimensionVariance\" \
(0.1), \"HomogeneousMaxVertexDegreeVariance\" (1.) and \
\"MinLocalComponentLifetimeMax\" (3).\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->504902198,ExpressionUUID->"490202a4-cc30-c545-928a-572632c602e1"],

Cell["\<\
The top-level \"Status\" is \"Provisional (owner review pending)\". The \
default thresholds are provisional: the project owner will review and revise \
them. A satisfied label is a structural classification within the explored \
limits, not evidence of any physical property.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->117455661,ExpressionUUID->"3333b83d-63a6-ad4e-9a97-21a7a7dd12a0"]
}, Open  ]],

